<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE AND ENGLAND DRAW AFTER RAIN PREVENTS PLAY.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE AND ENGLAND DRAW AFTER RAIN PREVENTS PLAY.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The second and final test between Zimbabwe and England was abandoned as a draw on Monday after heavy overnight rain prevented play on the final day. The first test in Bulawayo was also drawn.</p>
<p>Scores: England 156 and 195-3; Zimbabwe 215.</p>
</text>
